  {"file":"tank-arena.html","kind":"text","line":674,"zh":"驾驶一辆炮塔独立转向的主战坦克，穿过可破坏街区，利用反弹炮弹、侧后方弱点、波次升级或零件构筑击穿敌军。","en":"Drive a main battle tank with an independently steering turret through destructible city blocks, and break the enemy with bouncing shells, rear and flank weak points, wave upgrades or part builds."},
