  {"file":"tank-arena.html","kind":"text","line":686,"zh":"精英猎杀","en":"Elite Hunt"},
  {"file":"tank-arena.html","kind":"text","line":687,"zh":"敌人更少但更强，弱点命中和走位更重要。","en":"Fewer but stronger enemies; weak-point hits and positioning matter more."},
